//     morloc 0.100.2 (2026-09-02). The dice values are real; yours will
//     differ, because the program rolls dice.
//   * The `mim` transcripts were NOT run. The authoring machine is itself
//     inside a morloc container with no container engine and no mim
//     environment, so `mim new` could not execute. Those transcripts are
//     assembled from mim 0.28.0's own format strings in
//     mim/src/{main,provision,doctor,freeze,serve}.rs. They should be
